{
  "name": "496. A virtual key with a storage or Pub/Sub allowlist names only what the list covers (storage allowlist) [SERIAL]",
  "description": "TXE-7088. Local fixture regression, no live provider call: run with providerErrorFixture=1 against the gateway of tests/e2e/api/provider_config/provider-error-fixture.config.json, with tests/e2e/api/runners/provider-error-fixture.mjs as the only upstream. A request can carry the name of cloud storage or of a Pub/Sub topic that the provider reads, writes or publishes to with the operator's own cloud identity, which every virtual key on the provider shares. A virtual key can be limited to the storage and topics it may name (allowed_storage_prefixes, allowed_pubsub_topics); a key with no list is not restricted. The provider is the OpenAI-shaped stand-in storage_uri_files (the fixture's /pp/storage); what the folder pins is the gateway's check, which runs before any provider call and is the same code for every provider. 496.1 and 496.2 create a key limited to gs://bifrost-fixture-bucket/tenant-a/ and one topic, and a key with no lists. 496.3 serves the limited key inside its folder. 496.4 to 496.8 are the limited key outside it: as an input, by the https URL of the same object, in a folder whose name only starts with the allowed one, as a video task's output location and as a batch's output folder; each is a 403. 496.9 is a wildcard, a 400. 496.10 and 496.11 are another topic (403) and the key's own (served). 496.12 serves the key with no lists. 496.13 and 496.14 show an invalid entry refused on update and the key still limited. 496.15 reads what reached the provider: the three served chats and nothing else. TXE-7230: a raw body forwarded as it was received is read whole for topics less the members of its wire format that hold conversation text. 496.18 creates a key limited to one topic on Gemini. 496.19 is a native Gemini chat (raw body forwarded) whose prompt is exactly another topic's name, served; 496.20 is the same body with that topic in generationConfig, a 403. 496.21 reads that only the served chat reached Gemini, with its body as sent. 496.22 deletes the key.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "496.1 [setup] virtual key A (limited to tenant-a)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "  return;",
              "}",
              "pm.collectionVariables.unset('allowVkLimited'); pm.collectionVariables.unset('allowVkLimitedId');",
              "pm.sendRequest({ url: pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixtureUrl') + '/__reset', method: 'POST' }, function (err, res) {",
              "  pm.test('the fixture was reset', function () { pm.expect(err, String(err)).to.equal(null); pm.expect(res.code).to.equal(200); });",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('the virtual key was created', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code, pm.response.text()).to.equal(200); });",
              "var created = (pm.response.json() || {}).virtual_key || {};",
              "pm.test('it has an id and a value', function () { pm.expect(created.id, pm.response.text()).to.be.a('string').and.not.equal(''); pm.expect(created.value, pm.response.text()).to.be.a('string').and.not.equal(''); });",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('allowVkLimited', created.value || ''); pm.collectionVariables.set('allowVkLimitedId', created.id || '');",
              "pm.test('the lists are stored normalized', function () { pm.expect(created.allowed_storage_prefixes, pm.response.text()).to.eql(['gs://bifrost-fixture-bucket/tenant-a']); pm.expect(created.allowed_pubsub_topics, pm.response.text()).to.eql(['projects/fixture/topics/tenant-a']); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"name\": \"harness-496-a-{{$guid}}\", \"provider_configs\": [{\"provider\": \"storage_uri_files\", \"weight\": 1, \"allowed_models\": [\"*\"], \"key_ids\": [\"*\"]}], \"allowed_storage_prefixes\": [\"GS://bifrost-fixture-bucket/tenant-a/\"], \"allowed_pubsub_topics\": [\"projects/fixture/topics/tenant-a\"]}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
